# Frontend UI placement

Normative doc: `docs/decisions/frontend-ui-shared-module-boundaries.md` (also `frontend/AGENTS.md`).

## Do

1. Search `@eap/ui` / planned shared modules before adding chrome.
2. Put **all** basic components in `frontend/packages/ui` (export + BEM + `styles.css`).
3. Assemble feature UI from `@eap/ui`; place multi-feature composites per L2/L3 in the decision doc.
4. Stage `hooks` / `effects` / `layout` / `toggle` / `plugin` only as registered in that doc; extract `packages/*` only when §4 conditions hold.
5. Run `check:boundaries` and targeted tests; update §3.2 staging when parking shared code.

## Don't

- Parallel Button/Dialog/Confirm shells inside `features/*`
- Vague new packages (`shared-ui`, `components` at packages root) overlapping `@eap/ui`
- Domain API hooks inside `@eap/ui` or `@eap/hooks`
- Claiming planned packages as delivered without an approved slice
